# build
/target
Cargo.lock.bak

# internal docs — only README.md ships
/docs/

# crates.io name-reservation placeholders (throwaway)
/reserve/

# local junk
*.log
.DS_Store

# signing keys — NEVER commit. The committed dev key (git history) is burned
# and must be rotated before launch. See docs/Voli.md §10 key management.
/registry-dev/
# `*.signing-key.hex` needed a literal dot before "signing", so it never matched
# dev-signing-key.hex — exactly what `voli-index-tool keygen` writes.
*.hex
*.pem
*.key
.qwen/
.gstack/

# stela: python/unix reference kept for future Linux/macOS; the Rust engine ships
/crates/stela/reference/

# voli project memory (local knowledge, not for the repo)
.voli/
# the setup prompt is generated from crates/stela; a committed copy only
# goes stale the next time the wording changes
voli-memory-prompt*.md

# agent-local config and skills voli installs here; the skill's source of
# truth is skills/voli-memory/, and settings.local.json is personal
.claude/
